# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data-pipeline outputs (generated by `python -m bctc_collector ... --out <dir>`)
# Downloaded PDFs + catalogs can be hundreds of MB — never commit them.
# NOTE: tests/replay/ (incl. its _http_cache/ and PDFs) IS committed: the offline
# test suite depends on it, so do not add a global `_http_cache/` or `*.pdf` rule.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
pack_*/
data-pipeline/tmp/
data-pipeline/ocr_bench/

